# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Native/managed binaries — never normalize line endings, never attempt a diff.
# Covers the Roslyn DLLs vendored under Packages/com.unity.pipeline.
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.mdb binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary

# Luban 构建产物（Tools/）：整棵树不做行尾规范化、不参与文本 diff。
# 这批文件由 Tools/build-luban.bat 生成，其中的 .json/.xml/.sbn 若被 EOL 规范化，
# 每次重建都会产生永久性的假 diff。
/Tools/** -text -diff
